  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4103.21 Gasket or thread locking adhesive remover",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4103.21 “Gasket or thread locking adhesive remover” means a product designed or labeled to remove gaskets or thread locking adhesives. The term includes products labeled for dual use as a paint stripper and gasket remover or thread locking adhesive remover.\n\nSource. #10527, eff 2-26-14; ss by #13969, eff 5-21-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a4100.html"
